        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 139 and Firefox 150 apply <code class=\"notranslate\">overscroll-behavior</code> to non-scrollable scroll container (sic!), which <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1451\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/issues/1451/hovercard\">has affected MDN</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Chrome bug: <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41371072\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41371072</a></li>\n<li>Chrome commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/58b3245a17f6fca41439333f6a64a196b2c3cb0a/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/58b3245a17f6fca41439333f6a64a196b2c3cb0a\">chromium/chromium@<tt>58b3245</tt></a></li>\n<li>Firefox bug: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1837436\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1837436</a></li>\n<li>Firefox commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/03d810d70c8e5c8d58cab32004ca814715508b25/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/03d810d70c8e5c8d58cab32004ca814715508b25\">mozilla-firefox/firefox@<tt>03d810d</tt></a></li>\n<li>Safari bug: <a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=243452\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=243452</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
