        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF150 adds <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLImageElement.sizes</code> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">auto</code> and the corresponding attribute on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/img#sizes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;img&gt;</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1819581\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1819581</a>. This updates the features (one of which was partially updated in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4194585574\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29392\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29392/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29392\">#29392</a>)</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127818135\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43562\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43562/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43562\">mdn/content#43562</a></p>",
